  "decision": "supplement 01 D4 (item 136): (A) proportional split of B6 (main discussion), tested against the leave-one-out marginal contribution; (B) proportional split of the integrated total cost (Young et al.), tested for individual rationality",
  "A": "benefit_i = s_i x B6, payment_i = disconnected allocation_i - benefit_i; test: payment_i >= c'(i) (c'(i) = c(N) - c(N - i), D8 adjusted), i.e. benefit_i <= disconnected allocation_i - c'(i): otherwise the other players pay more than c(N - i). With B6 > 0 the benefit is never negative, so 'negative benefit' is not a test of (A). Only countries with a leave-one-out run.",
  "B": "payment_i = s_i x (c(N) - phi_BUNKER - SHARED) of the integrated run; test (individual rationality): payment_i <= disconnected allocation_i (+ the C1 (b) tolerance)"
 },
